{"3292470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tides of Annihilation", "steam_appid": 3292470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292470/extras/b340df3734a26dd935bc9735c13468c3.poster.avif?t=1788250889\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292470/extras/b340df3734a26dd935bc9735c13468c3.webm?t=1788250889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292470/extras/b340df3734a26dd935bc9735c13468c3.mp4?t=1788250889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has been left fractured by a sudden invasion from The Otherworld. As Gwendolyn, a survivor of the calamity, you will venture through a broken London where reality and fantasy bleed into one another, confront foes from beyond, and unveil the secrets of both worlds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Save a Shattered London on the Brink of Annihilation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Otherworld, of unknown origin, has descended upon London without warning. Streets and landmarks twist and crumble without end. The whole city is being torn asunder, slowly merging into The Otherworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the one who endured it all, you will face the invasion head-on, delve through richly layered levels, unearth the truth of the catastrophe, and find a way to save your family, the city, and perhaps the entire world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292470/extras/6b97785bcb51af0725e4e068b05a57a1.poster.avif?t=1788250889\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292470/extras/6b97785bcb51af0725e4e068b05a57a1.webm?t=1788250889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292470/extras/6b97785bcb51af0725e4e068b05a57a1.mp4?t=1788250889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Claim the Power of Knights, Forge Your Own Knight Set</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will encounter over a dozen legendary Knights of the Round Table drawn from Arthurian legend on your journey. Each wields distinct combat roles and abilities — ranging from vanguard charges and steadfast defense to explosive burst damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can assemble your knight set according to tactical needs or personal preference, crafting diverse combat builds. This not only yields fluid, ever-shifting combo chains but also gives rise to profound tactical depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will reshape battlefield dynamics, and never fight alone again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292470/extras/cc08228e6acb3161a027a58d802ef10f.poster.avif?t=1788250889\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292470/extras/cc08228e6acb3161a027a58d802ef10f.webm?t=1788250889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292470/extras/cc08228e6acb3161a027a58d802ef10f.mp4?t=1788250889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Encounter the Spectacular Colossal Knights Roaming the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Towering like mountains, the Colossal Knights wander between worlds. They are far more than majestic sights to be admired from afar — they are vast, silent arenas waiting to be stepped upon, explored, and challenged. You will clash with them in epic battles, scale their colossal forms, and venture deep into the palaces hidden within, uncovering the story each Colossal Knight bears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a scale never seen before, they will bring an entirely new dimension to both exploration and combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292470/extras/0fc537cc7fd89379f7bec1706b8db049.poster.avif?t=1788250889\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292470/extras/0fc537cc7fd89379f7bec1706b8db049.webm?t=1788250889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292470/extras/0fc537cc7fd89379f7bec1706b8db049.mp4?t=1788250889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292470/extras/b340df3734a26dd935bc9735c13468c3.poster.avif?t=1788250889\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292470/extras/b340df3734a26dd935bc9735c13468c3.webm?t=1788250889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292470/extras/b340df3734a26dd935bc9735c13468c3.mp4?t=1788250889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has been left fractured by a sudden invasion from The Otherworld. As Gwendolyn, a survivor of the calamity, you will venture through a broken London where reality and fantasy bleed into one another, confront foes from beyond, and unveil the secrets of both worlds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Save a Shattered London on the Brink of Annihilation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Otherworld, of unknown origin, has descended upon London without warning. Streets and landmarks twist and crumble without end. The whole city is being torn asunder, slowly merging into The Otherworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the one who endured it all, you will face the invasion head-on, delve through richly layered levels, unearth the truth of the catastrophe, and find a way to save your family, the city, and perhaps the entire world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292470/extras/6b97785bcb51af0725e4e068b05a57a1.poster.avif?t=1788250889\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292470/extras/6b97785bcb51af0725e4e068b05a57a1.webm?t=1788250889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292470/extras/6b97785bcb51af0725e4e068b05a57a1.mp4?t=1788250889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Claim the Power of Knights, Forge Your Own Knight Set</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will encounter over a dozen legendary Knights of the Round Table drawn from Arthurian legend on your journey. Each wields distinct combat roles and abilities — ranging from vanguard charges and steadfast defense to explosive burst damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can assemble your knight set according to tactical needs or personal preference, crafting diverse combat builds. This not only yields fluid, ever-shifting combo chains but also gives rise to profound tactical depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will reshape battlefield dynamics, and never fight alone again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292470/extras/cc08228e6acb3161a027a58d802ef10f.poster.avif?t=1788250889\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292470/extras/cc08228e6acb3161a027a58d802ef10f.webm?t=1788250889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292470/extras/cc08228e6acb3161a027a58d802ef10f.mp4?t=1788250889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Encounter the Spectacular Colossal Knights Roaming the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Towering like mountains, the Colossal Knights wander between worlds. They are far more than majestic sights to be admired from afar — they are vast, silent arenas waiting to be stepped upon, explored, and challenged. You will clash with them in epic battles, scale their colossal forms, and venture deep into the palaces hidden within, uncovering the story each Colossal Knight bears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a scale never seen before, they will bring an entirely new dimension to both exploration and combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292470/extras/0fc537cc7fd89379f7bec1706b8db049.poster.avif?t=1788250889\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292470/extras/0fc537cc7fd89379f7bec1706b8db049.webm?t=1788250889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292470/extras/0fc537cc7fd89379f7bec1706b8db049.mp4?t=1788250889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Tides of Annihilation is an action-adventure game steeped in the legends of King Arthur. When an otherworldly invasion shatters London, Gwendolyn, a lone survivor, embarks on a desperate quest to fight back and uncover the truth that lies beyond the veil.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292470/6ff5e6000c8ca199f44af13ec40a683e1921b114/header.jpg?t=1788250889", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292470/81808ea924832aea7e6890f6a6c287b7b690faa5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788250889", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292470/81808ea924832aea7e6890f6a6c287b7b690faa5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788250889", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "©2025 - ECLIPSE GLOW Games - All Rights Reserved", "developers": ["Eclipse Glow Games"], "publishers": ["Eclipse Glow Games"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 57, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 58, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 59, "description": "Steam Input API Support"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292470/ss_dcff0d70a39ae36f02eaee7e4a3c7be3a1bbe77c.6